error[E0601]: the spawned call is not task-safe: it reaches 'render', which is marked #NotThreadSafe
  --> $DIR/not-thread-safe-spawn.nra:13:9
   |
 4 | #NotThreadSafe
   | -------------- is marked #NotThreadSafe here
...
 9 | let work = func(value: int32) -> int32 => render(value);
   |                                           ------------- calls 'render'
...
13 |         spawn work(3);
   |         ^^^^^^^^^^^^^ this call must be task-safe
   |               ------- calls 'work'
   |
   = note: `neura check --task-safety` reports for every function whether it is task-safe, and why not

For more information about this error, try `neura explain E0601`.
